  "title": "Central America is ours",
  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Central America through its tram depot. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 9 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Central America Blackout: Ironwood Trust runs Central America from its tram depot, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Central America wakes up with the tram depot in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Central America before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
